{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/en/ep7/quest_story/17218020.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1721802001:1":{"text":"Ah... you're finally awake.","source_cn":"啊哈……你醒啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10AB3DA694FD49C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721802002:1":{"text":"You must've overcome that huge creature. Look at your soul! It's shining bright and steady!","source_cn":"看来你战胜了那个大家伙呢。你的灵魂波动变得……唔，很亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CD5C911F56FDE2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721802003:1":{"text":"... Yes, I did.","source_cn":"……是的，冕下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E42E70469429459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721802004:1":{"text":"I saw the dragon... it was nothing more than a projection of my own weakness.","source_cn":"我看到了……那个所谓“真实的巨龙”，其实就是我自己内心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC97CDEC4FF179EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721802005:1":{"text":"And I've bested it.","source_cn":"但我已经击败了它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x315BBDA494719889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721802006:1":{"text":"So, how are you feeling?","source_cn":"感觉如何？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D68540E21E9A148","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721802007:1":{"text":"Never better.","source_cn":"感觉……前所未有的好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA092CE178EECAEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721802008:1":{"text":"My grip on the bow is firm, and the voices of doubt in my head are gone. I know exactly what I must do now.","source_cn":"握弓的手不再犹豫，心里的杂音也消失了。我现在很清楚自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x523C6A7AB8AFA4EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721802009:1":{"text":"Aurora, thank you for your help. Through this dream, I've rediscovered what truly matters.","source_cn":"奥萝菈冕下，感谢您的援手。这场梦境让我找回了比箭术更重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1871F0417CB74059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721802010:1":{"text":"*Yawn* It's not a big deal...","source_cn":"唔……不用谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x641FD9D5D37B0A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721802011:1":{"text":"I really should go back to Avalon... and get some sleep...","source_cn":"那我也回阿瓦隆……补觉了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407C625B088DBDD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721802012:0":{"text":"It's time I head back to the base, ready my gear, and then set out for the battlefield...","source_cn":"我也该奔赴我要去的战场了……接下来，回到驻地整理行装直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CC65574FF6884BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721802013:1":{"text":"As for Father... I'll speak to him when I return victorious.","source_cn":"父亲那里……等我带着战功回来再向他致意吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BA7F7B1221409BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"Aurora","source":"奥萝菈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"Gwyneth","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep7/quest_story/17218030.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218030","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1721803001:0":{"text":"I need to make sure my warhorse is fed before hitting the road.","source_cn":"先喂喂战马吧，待会就可以直接出发了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44FBF2D55DE1B47B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"Gwyneth","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep7/quest_story/17218040.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218040","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1721804001:1":{"text":"Jacky, please give Cyclone a double ration and check its horseshoes. I need it in top condition, as I'll be heading out—","source_cn":"约翰，帮我给风暴喂双份的草料，再检查一下马蹄铁。我需要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8037F23419CF7C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721804002:1":{"text":"Good morning, my lady... I mean, Captain Gwyneth. No need to worry! Cyclone's already had his fill of the finest black beans and oats.","source_cn":"早安，大小姐……哦不，格温妮丝队长。您不用急，风暴已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE503007841D23D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721804003:1":{"text":"I replaced its horseshoes last night, and I've fitted the saddle for you.","source_cn":"马蹄铁昨晚刚换了新的，马鞍我也帮您装好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70471DB3233B3834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721804004:2":{"text":"All done? But I didn't tell anyone I'd be traveling far...","source_cn":"喂好了？我没有提前通知我要……出远门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB743F64289EB5FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721804005:2":{"text":"Gwyneth walks up to Cyclone and notices the saddlebags bulging on both sides, with even a spare quiver hung within easy reach.","source_cn":"格温妮丝走到战马旁，发现马鞍两侧的行囊鼓鼓囊囊的，甚至...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6B0FCEB18CD2788","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721804006:1":{"text":"She checks one of the saddlebags and finds it stuffed with jerky, water, medicinal herbs, and a pouch of gold coins.","source_cn":"她查看了一下行囊，里面是肉干、清水、急救草药，甚至还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA939C12629BF2728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721804007:1":{"text":"Jacky, what's with all this? Who asked you to prepare everything?","source_cn":"约翰，这是怎么回事？谁让你准备这些的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0531DB9A22FAA245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721804008:2":{"text":"It was the Commander. He came by earlier, before sunrise.","source_cn":"是司令大人。天还没亮的时候，司令大人就一个人来了这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7BD2FE8049E9578","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721804009:1":{"text":"He spent a long time with Cyclone, grooming him while telling me to get everything ready.","source_cn":"他在风暴旁边站了很久，一边帮它梳毛，一边吩咐我把这些东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25528E9B61973D3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721804010:1":{"text":"Father? I thought he was against me going to the front lines...","source_cn":"父亲……？他不是……一直反对我去前线吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB612781E162E13C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721804011:1":{"text":"I'm not sure about that, but I did hear the Commander say you're as stubborn as your bow...","source_cn":"那我就不知道了，我只听到了司令大人说您的脾气和手里的弓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x848B16843E486CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721804012:1":{"text":"He knew he couldn't stop you from leaving, so he wanted you to be fully prepared for the journey.","source_cn":"既然怎么拦都拦不住，与其让您赌气空着手跑出去受苦，不如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBB4C31569BA8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721804013:0":{"text":"Oh, and the Commander said this, \"Remind her to know her limits on the battlefield. Staying alive matters more than any glory.\"","source_cn":"哦，他还让我转告您——“告诉她，到了灰影郡别逞强。活着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD638C73AB1BA42C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721804014:2":{"text":"... Father worries too much. It's not like I can't look after myself.","source_cn":"……父亲也是，多此一举，我又不是不能照顾好自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FB219993F47E155","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721804015:0":{"text":"Yes, yes, the great Captain Gwyneth can handle everything on her own. Well... I guess I'll just wish you a safe journey.","source_cn":"是是是，队长最独立了。那……祝您平平安安顺顺利利？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCC483DB3832E44C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721804016:0":{"text":"Thank you, Jacky.","source_cn":"多谢你，约翰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA77429102DB6517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721804017:1":{"text":"One last look at my equipment... then I'll be on my way!","source_cn":"我最后再确认一遍行装……就离开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x123F0C278F26BACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"Gwyneth","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:马夫约翰":{"text":"Coachman Jacky","source":"马夫约翰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/en/ep7/quest_story/17218050.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218050","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1721805001:1":{"text":"I have everything I need... but why does it feel like something's missing?","source_cn":"装备齐全，补给充足……但是……总觉得少了点什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53CA3FBB28E6F93B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721805002:1":{"text":"The memory of yesterday's dream trial crosses Gwyneth's mind. In that dark world where everyone mocked her and urged her to give up, only a small purple figure remained by her side.","source_cn":"她的脑海中突然闪过昨日的梦境试炼。在那个被黑暗和嘲讽吞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF707D08CBFBE3390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721805003:1":{"text":"Allo. She has left her loyal drake toy behind.","source_cn":"——艾尔，少了那个一直陪伴她的龙玩偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE47D3D655ED616E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721805004:1":{"text":"What if something even harsher than the dream trial awaits me in Ashvale County? I can't face it alone.","source_cn":"如果这次去灰影郡是一场甚至比梦境更残酷的试炼，我怎么能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE6BEE426DF45E54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721805005:1":{"text":"Cyclone, we're making a detour. I left an important companion behind in my bedroom.","source_cn":"风暴，看来我们要先绕个远路了，我还有一个重要的伙伴落在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3459BB034EDA91FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721805006:1":{"text":"Let's head to the upper district first! We need to pick up Allo!","source_cn":"走！回上城区！去把艾尔接回来，然后——我们直奔灰影郡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72196679D0A1B607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"Gwyneth","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep7/quest_story/17218070.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218070","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1721807001:1":{"text":"Something's gone wrong in the central plaza!","source_cn":"中央广场出大事了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A11BB628F34EA3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721807002:1":{"text":"I hear it's about the Hall of Ancients.","source_cn":"听说跟圣古堂有关","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC8850CDB57631D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721807003:1":{"text":"The guards are rushing there...","source_cn":"去了好多守备军……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55B9FE55E11F6EAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721807004:1":{"text":"I'm steering clear of that area.","source_cn":"那我还是不去凑热闹了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DB87C66BEAE0C7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721807005:1":{"text":"The Hall of Ancients... is back?","source_cn":"圣古堂……回来了？在这种时候？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA79EC2C6214E20EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721807006:1":{"text":"Peggy and Cassadee might have returned as well...","source_cn":"如果是这样，那佩吉和科丝蒂是不是也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB90C245130FAC521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721807007:1":{"text":"And Father... A full-scale mobilization means the situation is dire.","source_cn":"还有父亲，全军出动意味着那边的情况可能极其不稳定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE7FEAF58176EFB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721807008:1":{"text":"... But I'm already set for Ashvale County. If Father sees me back now, he'll surely take me to task again for ignoring orders.","source_cn":"……我已经决定要去灰影郡了。现在回头，要是被父亲看到，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DF9CB4CADB0D1F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721807009:1":{"text":"As much as Gwyneth tries to persuade herself to get back on track, her body has other ideas.","source_cn":"格温妮丝试图说服自己继续赶路，但身体却诚实地僵在原地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB7EE0FF1A1A66DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721807010:1":{"text":"... It won't hurt to take a quick look, right?","source_cn":"……不行！我就去看一眼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B15149468BC112","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721807011:1":{"text":"I'm still the captain of the First Division. Although I've been assigned to Ashvale County, I remain in service to Savannah until I leave.","source_cn":"毕竟我是第一分队的队长，虽然接了调令，但在正式离开前，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8802756DD5B2C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721807012:1":{"text":"I-I can step in if the guards need help—that's it! I'll leave as soon as I know Peggy is safe!","source_cn":"万一其他人处理不好现场，我也能……我也能帮把手。对，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA67417EB5DC0E1DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1721807013:1":{"text":"Gwyneth turns around, pushing against the flow of the crowd...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB739AA0BC11A0FD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1721807014:1":{"text":"Once again, she plunges back into the eye of the storm!","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92D7092B9F37DCF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族1":{"text":"Lady A","source":"贵族1","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族2":{"text":"Lady B","source":"贵族2","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"Gwyneth","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_coun